# The data is real: names, national IDs, addresses, ID-card photos. None of it
# belongs in a public repository, so the file types it arrives in are refused
# here as a second line of defence. The spreadsheets live outside the project,
# in "NCM DATA (خاص)" on the Desktop.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv
*.tsv
*.docx

# Signing keys and tokens live in C:\Users\Security\.ncm-secrets, never here.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.zip
*token*
.env

# Android build output
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

# Editor and OS litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Khaled works inside "FOR WORK/": the live spreadsheets, the photo archive and
# the daily-task scripts (with their Apps Script secret) were moved in here on
# 5 Sep 2026 so everything he edits sits in one place. It is real data sitting
# in a PUBLIC repository's working tree - nothing in it may EVER be committed.
/FOR WORK/
